 * Design Patterns Applied:
 *  - Observer Pattern: Real-time ball-by-ball score and wicket broadcasts to thousands of subscribers
 *  - Strategy Pattern: Dynamic Net Run Rate (NRR) and strike-rate calculation strategies
 *  - Factory Pattern: Match, Innings, and Over object generation
